{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"agent_message","text":"@standalone edit implement vim-like visual selection and yanking in terminal panes\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: src/ui.rs\n@@\n pub enum UiMode {\n     Command,\n     Insert,\n     Prompt,\n+    Visual,\n+    VisualLine,\n+    VisualBlock,\n }\n@@\n pub enum UiKey {\n     Char(char),\n     Esc,\n+    CtrlV,\n     CtrlW,\n     Up,\n     Down,\n     Left,\n@@\n enum PendingKey {\n     CtrlW,\n     G,\n }\n+\n+#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Eq, PartialEq)]\n+enum VisualSelectionKind {\n+    Character,\n+    Line,\n+    Block,\n+}\n+\n+impl VisualSelectionKind {\n+    fn ui_mode(self) -> UiMode {\n+        match self {\n+            Self::Character => UiMode::Visual,\n+            Self::Line => UiMode::VisualLine,\n+            Self::Block => UiMode::VisualBlock,\n+        }\n+    }\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Eq, PartialEq)]\n+struct TextPosition {\n+    row: usize,\n+    column: usize,\n+}\n+\n+#[derive(Clone, Debug, Eq, PartialEq)]\n+struct VisualSelection {\n+    pane: PaneFocus,\n+    kind: VisualSelectionKind,\n+    anchor: TextPosition,\n+    cursor: TextPosition,\n+}\n@@\n enum LeftPaneClickTarget {\n     Command,\n     Agent(AgentId),\n }\n+\n+#[derive(Clone, Debug, Eq, PartialEq)]\n+struct LeftPaneRow {\n+    text: String,\n+    reversed: bool,\n+}\n@@\n     pending_bell: Cell<bool>,\n+    pending_clipboard: Cell<bool>,\n+    visual_selection: Option<VisualSelection>,\n+    last_yanked_text: Option<String>,\n     status_notice: Option<StatusNotice>,\n     command_mode_typing_count: usize,\n     command_mode_typing_controls_only: bool,\n@@\n             right_scroll_rows: 0,\n             pending: None,\n             pending_bell: Cell::new(false),\n+            pending_clipboard: Cell::new(false),\n+            visual_selection: None,\n+            last_yanked_text: None,\n             status_notice: None,\n             command_mode_typing_count: 0,\n             comman